gopher.gif is the running gopher sprite from
https://github.com/egonelbre/gophers (animation/2bit-sprite/run.gif), by
Egon Elbre, released under CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication):
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

